{title: Jalwanuma}
{artist: Sharib Toshi Sabri}
{key: C#m}

{c: Verse 1}
Teri [C#m]saadgi, teri dilkashi,        Teri [F#m]baat aaye naa
[C#m]Aisa kabhi hota nahi,        Teri [F#m]yaad aaye naa
[C#m]Teri yaadon mein [G#]hoon khoya,        [C#m]Kai raaton se [G#]naa soya
[C#m]Raha tanha [G#]hansa-roya,        [A]Ho ho ho [B]ho
[C#m]Jalwanu [B]ma tu har [A]jagah,        Tu har [G#m]kahin hai jaana
[C#m]Tere bi [B]na jeena [A]mera,        Mumkin [G#m]nahi hai jaana
[C#m] [B] [A] [G#m]
[C#m]Mere [B]khayalon mein tu,        [C#m]Dil ke [B]sawalon mein tu
[C#m]Armaan hai [B]mujhme bas [C#m]tera,        [C#m]Shab ke [B]andhero mein tu
[C#m]Din ke [B]ujaalon mein tu,        [C#m]Har lamha [B]tujhse hai [C#m]juda
Jab [C#m]shaam dhale, har [B]saans jale,        Naa [A]zor chale [G#m]mera
[C#m]Jalwanu [B]ma tu har [A]jagah,        Tu har [G#m]kahin hai jaana
[C#m]Tere bi [B]na jeena [A]mera,        Mumkin [G#m]nahi hai jaana
[C#m] [B] [A] [G#m]
[C#m]Khwaabon ki [B]baarish mein tu,        [C#m]Jeene ki [B]khwaahish mein tu
[C#m]Behte [B]lahoome tu [C#m]rawana,        [C#m]Fitrat [B]iraadon ki tu
[C#m]Hasrat hai [B]raaton ki tu,        [C#m]Subah ki [B]tu hi [C#m]ilteja
Hai [C#m]dil ki sada ab [B]door na ja,        Tu [A]chaino sukoon [G#m]mera
[C#m]Jalwanu [B]ma tu har [A]jagah,        Tu har [G#m]kahin hai jaana
[C#m]Tere bi [B]na jeena [A]mera,        Mumkin [G#m]nahi hai jaana
[C#m]Jalwanu [B]ma tu har [A]jagah,        Tu har [G#m]kahin hai jaana
[C#m]Tere bi [B]na jeena [A]mera,        Mumkin [G#m]nahi hai jaana
